72:She had kept a count of her hand's ignition margin since Greyvane. Three times before, she had pushed her heat past where the skin could take it, and three times it had healed, and she had logged every one in this notebook in her small exact hand. The fourth was in her left hand, and it was enormous, and it was crooked. She looked at it for a moment and did not try to make it neater.

